WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.421
Mention reasons for taking and keeping records regularly.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:08.908
The curriculum places record keeping alongside classroom sketching. A record is

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.430
information written down for later use.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:17.029
We record dates, attendance, borrowed books or plant growth to help us remember

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:21.774
accurately and make decisions. Records should be clear, kept safely and checked when

00:00:21.774 --> 00:00:22.139
needed.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.494
Create a simple four-day chart of classroom plant observations with your teacher.
